{"unit_id":"Fucaplos__dsh-local-library#card-zh","repo":"Fucaplos/dsh-local-library","commit":"2654b21abd79ea170738714cb39d4d7d2ec482f1","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-local-library 是面向 DSH Desktop 网页端的本地资料库插件。它在设置侧栏加入资料库界面，并通过宿主端工具让各会话列出、搜索、读取和保存文件。用户可上传文档与图片，检索文件名及抽取后的正文，并将长文分段读取；配置信息视觉服务后，图片也可生成描述并参与搜索。适合希望在多个 DSH 对话间复用个人文件、笔记或报告的人。基础资料库保存在本机；可选图片描述会调用配置的视觉服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["package.json:21","cordis.patch.yml:5","lib/client.js:1058","lib/index.js:430","lib/index.js:509","lib/index.js:619","lib/index.js:724"]}
{"unit_id":"Fucaplos__dsh-local-library#card-en","repo":"Fucaplos/dsh-local-library","commit":"2654b21abd79ea170738714cb39d4d7d2ec482f1","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-local-library is a local document library for DSH Desktop. It adds a Settings section and tools to search, read, and save files across chats. Uploaded documents can be searched by extracted text. Optional vision setup indexes image descriptions; files are otherwise kept in the local library.","source":"generated","evidence":["package.json:21","cordis.patch.yml:5","lib/client.js:1058","lib/index.js:430","lib/index.js:509","lib/index.js:619","lib/index.js:724"]}
