{"unit_id":"Fucaplos__dsh-local-library#feature-1","repo":"Fucaplos/dsh-local-library","commit":"2654b21abd79ea170738714cb39d4d7d2ec482f1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-local-library 的功能「资料搜索与分段阅读」：按关键词查找本地文件名和抽取正文，再读取长文本。调用 library_search 搜索，并用 library_read 读取或续读。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:509","lib/index.js:619"]}
{"unit_id":"Fucaplos__dsh-local-library#feature-2","repo":"Fucaplos/dsh-local-library","commit":"2654b21abd79ea170738714cb39d4d7d2ec482f1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-local-library 的功能「跨会话保存资料」：用户可在对话中将整理好的文字、笔记或报告草稿存入资料库，供之后的会话检索。调用 library_save，提供文件名和正文，也可附加标签。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:724"]}
{"unit_id":"Fucaplos__dsh-local-library#caveat-1","repo":"Fucaplos/dsh-local-library","commit":"2654b21abd79ea170738714cb39d4d7d2ec482f1","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-local-library 使用前须知：启用图片视觉描述时，图片内容会连同提示发送至配置的视觉接口；没有启用时图片仍可保存，但不能按图片内容检索。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/vision.js:31","lib/vision.js:72","lib/index.js:125"]}
